{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05793","headline":"嵩山十志十首 其九 · 卢鸿一","name":"嵩山十志十首 其九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岚气肃兮岩翠冥，空阴虚兮户芳迎。\n披蕙帐兮促萝筵，谈空空兮核元元。\n蕙帐萝筵兮洞元室，秘而幽兮真可吉。\n返自然兮道可冥，泽妙思兮草玄经，结幽门兮在黄庭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢鸿一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}